      "content_html": "<p>Цифры до 10:</p><table><tr><th>Турецкий</th><th>Число</th></tr><tr><td>sıfır</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>bir</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>iki</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>üç</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>dört</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>beş</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>altı</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>yedi</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>sekiz</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>dokuz</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>on</td><td>10</td></tr></table><p>11 = on bir, 20 = yirmi, 30 = otuz, 40 = kırk, 50 = elli, 60 = altmış, 70 = yetmiş, 80 = seksen, 90 = doksan, 100 = yüz.</p>",
